  "plan": {
    "goal": "Co-seed HUVEC and HepG2 in a 24-well plate at 1.36e5 cells/cm² total across 1.66 cm² per well, with 0.783 of the total assigned to HUVEC, and report per-well and total seeding counts and the A:B ratio.",
    "rationale": "HUVEC (population A) and HepG2 (population B) are co-seeded as a vascularized liver-lobule model. Total density 1.36e5 cells/cm² over 1.66 cm²/well with fraction A = 0.783 gives a HUVEC-dominant seeding (A:B ≈ 3.6:1). Per-well counts and totals are computed from these raw inputs. Assumes the full 24-well plate (24 wells) is seeded; totals scale linearly if fewer wells are used. HepG2 proliferates during culture (doubling 48-60 h), so the functional A:B ratio will drift toward B over time.",
